-- expect-refusal: reads derived_by beside the lattice
-- examples/checks/agg-lattice-safety-8-refused-provenance.rofl — a cell that improves withdraws its old firings, so provenance read while the evaluation runs would change under its reader.
edb(alsf_e).
alsf_e(a, b, 2).
lattice alsf_pv(A, min D).
alsf_pv(A, D) :- alsf_e(A, _, D).
alsf_who(R) :- derived_by(_, R, _).
